Description: SkillFishOS kernel (linux-tkg 7.2.6-skillfishos / 7.2.6-skillfishos-x64)
 Meta-package that downloads and installs the prebuilt linux-tkg kernel (image
 + headers) from the SkillFishOS GitHub release. It picks the right build for the
 machine it is installed on: 7.2.6-skillfishos on an AMD BC-250, 7.2.6-skillfishos-x64 on
 any other x86-64 PC. The ~150 MB kernel image is hosted as a release asset
 because GitHub's 100 MB/file limit prevents shipping it in the APT pool.

